  "writing_rules": [
    "Load this template before creating or structurally editing a target owner.",
    "Do not add an unregistered field. A new field requires maintenance-time template/schema revision first.",
    "House permanent units, member assignment classification, standing readiness order, and House operating process are fields of the House owner; do not create mutable sidecar owners that mirror them.",
    "Dynamic/open maps permit new IDs only; each value must still satisfy the wildcard value contract.",
    "Indexes/caches are rebuilt from authority and never used to bless new authoritative fields.",
    "Canonical key order is a writing convention only; semantic validation does not depend on JSON object order.",
    "House Tang ordinary personnel may be represented as aggregate cohort counts/profiles inside the House owner; members arrays contain only persistent exact/person-lite identities.",
    "Group development updates a cohort profile once. Do not fan out routine training writes across anonymous cohort members."
  ]
